      "text": "DiBadili Institute · A Digital Public Good CRAFT Capacity Readiness & Fiduciary Assurance Toolkit The CRAFT Framework: Building Fiduciary Trust for Direct G2G, DFI and Donor Partnerships. Register Your Institution Explore the Methodology CRAFT · ICARF V4.0",
