    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 764,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 578,
      "heading": "The blindspots CRAFT was built to expose.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "UNIVERSAL INSTITUTIONAL FAILURES The blindspots CRAFT was built to expose. Abstracted from fiduciary assessments across the globe, the same structural gaps recur regardless of geography or mandate. The Spreadsheet Trap Legacy accounting systems unable to generate automated donor-specific trial balances. The Sub-National Blindspot Centralized logistics systems with critically low facility-level reporting. The Paper Compliance Illusion Institutions with perfect policy manuals but zero system-enforced implementation. The Anonymity Gap Whistleblowing mechanisms requiring staff names, deterring fra",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 1342,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 516,
      "heading": "Built for every institution in the trust chain.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "ONE FRAMEWORK, THREE INSTITUTIONAL REALITIES Built for every institution in the trust chain. A universal fiduciary core applies to all institutions. CRAFT then adapts the questions, evidence and Data Room to your organizational archetype - so you are measured against the standard that actually governs your funding. Public Sector FOR G2G FUNDING & PUBLIC ACCOUNTABILITY Ministries, agencies, regulators & sub-national entities Ministry Agency National Public Health Institute (NPHI) Regulatory Authority Sub-National Entity Civil Society FOR GRANT ELIGIBILITY & DONOR TRUST NGOs, foundations, cooper",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1859,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 476,
      "heading": "A four-layer lifecycle, from intent to execution.",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "A four-layer lifecycle, from intent to execution. 01 Assessment Diagnose institutional readiness across 5 tiers and 20 domains using a 0–5 maturity scale backed by a 7-point evidence matrix. 02 Accreditation Compute a Level A–E rating. The Paper Compliance Penalty Engine caps the level when implementation evidence is weak. 03 Strengthening Convert every gap into a costed, owned, and time-bound action within a Capacity Improvement Plan scheduled to your own chosen timeframe. 04 Monitoring Track validated execution over time, re-scoring as evidence matures and donor frameworks evolve.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 2334,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 420,
      "heading": "Pan-African excellence, institutional gravity.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "Pan-African excellence, institutional gravity. CRAFT carries the DiBadili Institute's commitment to integrity, sovereignty, and continuous development, engineered for the institutions shaping Africa's transformation. Excellence in Institutional Quality Pan-African Perspective Integrity & Principled Leadership Afro-Continuous Development Mindset Multi-Tenant Isolation Scoped strictly by organization_id. Execution-First Scoring Paper compliance never inflates a score.",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2754,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 415,
      "heading": "See CRAFT with live sample data.",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Demo: Assessor Workspace",
        "Demo: Portfolio View",
        "See demo"
      ],
      "text": "EXPLORE BEFORE YOU REGISTER See CRAFT with live sample data. Open a fully populated, read-only demo in a new tab, with every screen pre-loaded with illustrative institutions. The demo is completely isolated and never touches a real workspace. Demo: Assessor Workspace Demo: Portfolio View See demo",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
